    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take on an epic adventure of cosmic proportions in <i>Out of Orbit</i>. Design, build, and manage your very own spacecraft. Raid, destroy, infiltrate, or steal enemy spaceships. Befriend or jeopardize factions. Build bases on planets to expand your influence and resources. Command your crew. Collect raw ores. Travel through wormholes to unlock new randomly generated universes. The sky is the limit. Literally.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/6de17d992f24edb1636968e70c44eda9.webp?t=1751048925\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/7f9e27109f53a1b31e07d14442a7c30e.poster.avif?t=1751048925\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/7f9e27109f53a1b31e07d14442a7c30e.webm?t=1751048925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><strong>Build your own block based spaceships! The possibilities are endless!\u00a0</strong>Every ship is fully destructible and explorable, board them, fly them, crash them into others, or become a space pirate and seize vessels. Manage your fuel and power supply to keep your ship running and stay one step ahead in the galaxy. You can even upload your ship to the workshop page where other players can download and integrate them into their game.  <br>   <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/0308379c791a07fe95dfb12b235576d9.webp?t=1751048925\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/6806fc12ca764d748857a368f06b0963.poster.avif?t=1751048925\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/6806fc12ca764d748857a368f06b0963.webm?t=1751048925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/6806fc12ca764d748857a368f06b0963.mp4?t=1751048925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Issue orders, rally their support, and lead them into battle as you plunder enemy ships across the stars.</strong> Your crew isn\u2019t just along for the ride, they can assist in boarding vessels or help maintain and upgrade your own spaceship. Leadership comes with responsibility.\u00a0Manage their loyalty, sanity, thirst, sleep, hunger, and health.\u00a0Neglect their needs, and you risk mutiny. Care for them well, and they\u2019ll follow you through the darkest void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/5e72b9c6c93b4bc3547e747c2a975d7a.webp?t=1751048925\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/f3ee79906d242d51f5a337e13cc5484c.poster.avif?t=1751048925\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/f3ee79906d242d51f5a337e13cc5484c.webm?t=1751048925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/f3ee79906d242d51f5a337e13cc5484c.mp4?t=1751048925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Monitor and maintain your fuel, oxygen, thirst, hunger, radiation levels, and health, every resource matters when survival is on the line.</strong> Mine asteroids for vital ores. Conduct scientific experiments to unlock new stations, items, and  objects that may change your fate. Take care of yourself and you just might make it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/84bba43ee2c02c43e85d04602462f0ad.webp?t=1751048925\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/66f14fd0da38e2550b8ee2553fa2f92b.poster.avif?t=1751048925\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/66f14fd0da38e2550b8ee2553fa2f92b.webm?t=1751048925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/66f14fd0da38e2550b8ee2553fa2f92b.mp4?t=1751048925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel to breathtaking, unique locations, explore the heart of supernovas, drift through molecular clouds, and land on distant planets to establish your own thriving base. Dare to enter black holes and unlock new, randomly generated universes, each more mysterious and unpredictable than the last. The galaxy is waiting. Where will you go first?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We plan to keep growing, expanding, and improving Out of Orbit with the support of the community.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take on an epic adventure of cosmic proportions in <i>Out of Orbit</i>. Design, build, and manage your very own spacecraft. Raid, destroy, infiltrate, or steal enemy spaceships. Befriend or jeopardize factions. Build bases on planets to expand your influence and resources. Command your crew. Collect raw ores. Travel through wormholes to unlock new randomly generated universes. The sky is the limit. Literally.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/6de17d992f24edb1636968e70c44eda9.webp?t=1751048925\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/7f9e27109f53a1b31e07d14442a7c30e.poster.avif?t=1751048925\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/7f9e27109f53a1b31e07d14442a7c30e.webm?t=1751048925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><strong>Build your own block based spaceships! The possibilities are endless!\u00a0</strong>Every ship is fully destructible and explorable, board them, fly them, crash them into others, or become a space pirate and seize vessels. Manage your fuel and power supply to keep your ship running and stay one step ahead in the galaxy. You can even upload your ship to the workshop page where other players can download and integrate them into their game.  <br>   <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/0308379c791a07fe95dfb12b235576d9.webp?t=1751048925\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/6806fc12ca764d748857a368f06b0963.poster.avif?t=1751048925\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/6806fc12ca764d748857a368f06b0963.webm?t=1751048925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/6806fc12ca764d748857a368f06b0963.mp4?t=1751048925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Issue orders, rally their support, and lead them into battle as you plunder enemy ships across the stars.</strong> Your crew isn\u2019t just along for the ride, they can assist in boarding vessels or help maintain and upgrade your own spaceship. Leadership comes with responsibility.\u00a0Manage their loyalty, sanity, thirst, sleep, hunger, and health.\u00a0Neglect their needs, and you risk mutiny. Care for them well, and they\u2019ll follow you through the darkest void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/5e72b9c6c93b4bc3547e747c2a975d7a.webp?t=1751048925\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/f3ee79906d242d51f5a337e13cc5484c.poster.avif?t=1751048925\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/f3ee79906d242d51f5a337e13cc5484c.webm?t=1751048925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/f3ee79906d242d51f5a337e13cc5484c.mp4?t=1751048925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Monitor and maintain your fuel, oxygen, thirst, hunger, radiation levels, and health, every resource matters when survival is on the line.</strong> Mine asteroids for vital ores. Conduct scientific experiments to unlock new stations, items, and  objects that may change your fate. Take care of yourself and you just might make it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/84bba43ee2c02c43e85d04602462f0ad.webp?t=1751048925\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/66f14fd0da38e2550b8ee2553fa2f92b.poster.avif?t=1751048925\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/66f14fd0da38e2550b8ee2553fa2f92b.webm?t=1751048925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859990/extras/66f14fd0da38e2550b8ee2553fa2f92b.mp4?t=1751048925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel to breathtaking, unique locations, explore the heart of supernovas, drift through molecular clouds, and land on distant planets to establish your own thriving base. Dare to enter black holes and unlock new, randomly generated universes, each more mysterious and unpredictable than the last. The galaxy is waiting. Where will you go first?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We plan to keep growing, expanding, and improving Out of Orbit with the support of the community.</p>",
